As a Technical Lead, I agree that wrapping this in a proper DTO rather than returning a raw boolean is the best approach. It adheres to the Open/Closed Principle (OCP)—if we ever need to add a "reason" string or additional flags later, we just add fields to the DTO without breaking the frontend contract.
Here is the complete, SOLID-compliant implementation from the database layer up to the Controller.
