2. Update the Repository (CommonRequestRepository.java)
Spring Data JPA's existsBy... is highly optimized. Instead of fetching the entire row, it runs a fast SELECT 1 ... FETCH FIRST 1 ROWS ONLY query, which is extremely efficient for this kind of boolean check.
