Why this design is enterprise-ready:
 * Single Responsibility Principle (SRP): The Controller only handles HTTP routing. The Service handles the ! inversion logic. The Repository strictly executes the optimized database SQL.
 * Performance: existsBy generates an EXISTS SQL clause. It stops scanning the database the millisecond it finds a single matching row, which is massively faster than doing a .count() or .findAll().
